  "content": "<h1>防燃附魔</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&amp;color=blue&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fburnless-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/burnless-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><code>防燃</code>是一种用于盔甲的新附魔，可减少你的燃烧时间。为全套盔甲装备防燃附魔，任何燃烧效果都会立即消失！</p><p>该附魔可以通过附魔台、战利品箱或与村民交易获得。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>👾 漏洞/问题</h2><p>请在<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>中报告任何问题/漏洞。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>⌨️ 命令</h2><p>给予：</p><pre><code>/loot give @s loot burnless_enchantment:burnless</code></pre><p>附魔：</p><pre><code>/enchant @s burnless_enchantment:burnless</code></pre><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🪪 许可证</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🎁 服务器托管</h2><p>创建自己的服务器可能是一个非常耗时、繁琐且成本高昂的过程。</p><p>但通过BisectHosting，只需点击几下即可获得自己的服务器！凭借他们24/7的支持和快速响应时间，任何问题都不会阻碍你的脚步！感兴趣吗？那么我们为你准备了一份优惠！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"服务器托管\"></p>",
